                            <comment id="503418" author="paf0186" created="Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:50:53 +0000">&lt;p&gt;The "Expect 3 found on mds1" duplicate OST scan is fixed by &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/c/68698" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/68698&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17891" title="sanity-lfsck test_18e: Expect 2 orphans have been fixed, but got: 4" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-17891"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-17891&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;), landed 2026-09-29. Every failure since then that we checked tested a base without it. Disabling 68698's two queue guards reproduces the failure locally; with them, 10/10 controlled runs passed. Failures on older bases go away after a rebase.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A separate signature (an object left over from test_18a) is seen only on 68928 and is not covered here.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
